{
 "id": "seg5a",
 "title": "怎么守",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 132.1,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5a-00",
   "text": "下面是手册给出的一套示例架构。它综合了公开事件的教训，不是哪家交易所公布的方案。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 7.632,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 8.386
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-01",
   "text": "账本，意图签发，策略引擎，审批，签名集群，广播，链上，再加一套独立监控。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-01.mp3",
   "start": 9.452,
   "dur": 8.928,
   "speechStart": 9.55,
   "speechEnd": 17.538
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-02",
   "text": "开发电脑到签名集群，这条线是禁止的。网络上根本不该有这条路由。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-02.mp3",
   "start": 18.6,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 18.698,
   "speechEnd": 24.481
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-03",
   "text": "我们挑四个重点。第一，账本绑定签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-03.mp3",
   "start": 25.54,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 25.638,
   "speechEnd": 29.492
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-04",
   "text": "签名服务只为账本里存在、状态正确、金额一致的提现单签名。同一张单，只能签一次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-04.mp3",
   "start": 30.56,
   "dur": 8.688,
   "speechStart": 30.659,
   "speechEnd": 38.409,
   "spoken": "签名服务只给账本里存在、状态正确、金额一致的提现单签名。同一张单，只能签一次。"
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-05",
   "text": "目标和金额，要从原始交易里解析出来，不读上游写的描述。伪造的提现指令，在这里对不上账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-05.mp3",
   "start": 39.468,
   "dur": 8.592,
   "speechStart": 39.566,
   "speechEnd": 47.23
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-06",
   "text": "第二，策略读的是原始待签字节，而且默认拒绝。没有明确规则的交易类型，一律不签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-06.mp3",
   "start": 48.28,
   "dur": 8.592,
   "speechStart": 48.378,
   "speechEnd": 56.042
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-07",
   "text": "比如 Safe 多签，operation 只允许等于 0。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-07.mp3",
   "start": 57.092,
   "dur": 4.704,
   "speechStart": 57.19,
   "speechEnd": 60.963
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-08",
   "text": "要用 1，只能指向官方的批量调用合约，链上还有 Guard 合约再拦一次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-08.mp3",
   "start": 62.016,
   "dur": 6.312,
   "speechStart": 62.115,
   "speechEnd": 67.473,
   "spoken": "要用 1，只能指向官方的批量掉用合约，链上还有 Guard 合约再拦一次。"
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-09",
   "text": "Bybit 那笔 operation 等于 1 的交易，在这里会被拒绝。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-09.mp3",
   "start": 68.548,
   "dur": 4.752,
   "speechStart": 68.646,
   "speechEnd": 72.467
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-10",
   "text": "再比如热钱包，EIP-7702 授权一律拒签。策略如果覆盖了这一条，Binance 那批委托就签不出来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-10.mp3",
   "start": 73.52,
   "dur": 9.432,
   "speechStart": 73.618,
   "speechEnd": 82.115
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-11",
   "text": "第三，分链熔断。某条链流出异常，就停这条链的广播。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-11.mp3",
   "start": 83.172,
   "dur": 5.928,
   "speechStart": 83.27,
   "speechEnd": 88.267
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-12",
   "text": "发现账本里没有对应订单的流出，所有链一起停。熔断的开关，不能依赖已经被攻击的系统。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-12.mp3",
   "start": 89.32,
   "dur": 8.04,
   "speechStart": 89.418,
   "speechEnd": 96.522
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-13",
   "text": "第四，紧急撤销。7702 委托，要用一笔新的授权，把委托地址设成零地址，才能清掉。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-13.mp3",
   "start": 97.58,
   "dur": 9.096,
   "speechStart": 97.678,
   "speechEnd": 105.83
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-14",
   "text": "MPC 钱包没有一把单独的私钥能立刻做这件事。所以要有一条独立的撤销路径，预先批准，每季度演练，记下用时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-14.mp3",
   "start": 106.896,
   "dur": 10.896,
   "speechStart": 106.994,
   "speechEnd": 116.967
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-15",
   "text": "最后查一下账户代码，结果为空，才算完成。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-15.mp3",
   "start": 118.012,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 118.11,
   "speechEnd": 121.479
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-16",
   "text": "也要说清局限。架构挡不住所有内部人作恶。它做的，是把一个人作恶，变成需要多人共谋。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg5a-16.mp3",
   "start": 122.552,
   "dur": 8.352,
   "speechStart": 122.65,
   "speechEnd": 130.052
  }
 ],
